  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Combien faut-il compter par personne, environ ?",
      "textSHA256": "59816228fa76d127488d551fe1bdd7035688a6c8853fa28a796c18a927d9a020",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Dois-je faire une réservation ?",
      "textSHA256": "96a15537c382e8a956867538a3d0d5eee8b3200a3b657a921a2526269325a4db",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Elle explique que c'est l'anniversaire de son mari et qu'elle veut de la cuisine régionale, pas un endroit pour touristes.",
      "textSHA256": "229f7f775f13b10ea7e1f1322b7f3b7f4886ee279ad27a0b2789d1637bc50684",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Ensuite, elle demande : « Dois-je faire une réservation ? »",
      "textSHA256": "e36608e8c55b9080a73704835c2af88bbe8568a5aa171ac4ab951f2318338fd4",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il répond que, d'après la carte du restaurant, un plat principal coûte environ 250 pesos et que le menu dégustation du vendredi coûte 450 pesos.",
      "textSHA256": "e8e0623f1ef54c6f30491ead3d8d25089d1ca060e9191e809e928cfe04dd9ade",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je voudrais de la cuisine régionale, pas un endroit pour touristes.",
      "textSHA256": "be7174139fb4cc5b6e25ca84ade05a59758cb35a393e937209c1b7a48c2a9868",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura demande : « Combien faut-il compter par personne, environ ? »",
      "textSHA256": "c07200cf4920b1b849c090a46d5898c7ece258e24e98064e5401ca79b657107e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura demande : « Que me recommandez-vous de commander là-bas ? »",
      "textSHA256": "ce312888623eed1853a528ca129db284f94db38813f2540907b9d64585ab666d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le concierge dit : « Les gens d'ici commandent le mole, le plat typique. Prévenez le restaurant que vous fêtez quelque chose, parce que parfois le chef envoie un dessert spécial. »",
      "textSHA256": "a1c74fdad63da25372558fa54fcf8c9256b44e6cfff153e33b9c7bc0d8ea5de7",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le concierge dit que oui, parce que le vendredi, c'est presque toujours complet.",
      "textSHA256": "cbbf3257ce834366fb1c3e793f4b325253e8def45b2141a09510419a02d10c9c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le concierge lui recommande un restaurant familial parce que l'ambiance y est tranquille et que la cuisine est faite maison.",
      "textSHA256": "297aec4b33e2aaa4e3f4a4ce374ab10955615dd14aa0312a7042dc103eaa0654",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Le menu dégustation du vendredi coûte 450 pesos.",
      "textSHA256": "716b768f3ed2ba3ec874e82cd57f6e99fa5819df9f1390c77b8a595719194124",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Merci beaucoup pour vos conseils.",
      "textSHA256": "dfcada84fecf8545d88165c3f12ec6488de35adf72f1a1c5a13ef7e690f6d7b1",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 23
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Où vont les gens d'ici pour fêter quelque chose ?",
      "textSHA256": "ac99f071603f37a01c1815a9e39d8b18c1ca03180ef43d9be7abf4529e207347",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 13
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Prévenez le restaurant que vous fêtez quelque chose.",
      "textSHA256": "4a9e026c853294d65108a18784ddb1d978a0f2df3abd9ee69888c550a9b2e634",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Que me recommandez-vous de commander là-bas ?",
      "textSHA256": "48d1cbd50bd3f09b2cfb14c4c6ddcc937165df86c42c0b1a7d3b7f26360318af",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Si c'est complet, y a-t-il une autre option près d'ici ?",
      "textSHA256": "e0994fee726df667fdca6146ec097e9cb601d1561694a7709c8bd67bfbd8778c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Un plat principal coûte environ 250 pesos.",
      "textSHA256": "96391a2ece14bad8ca465529b20eac60b0854bee4003610709b3b81053d460d0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Y a-t-il quelque chose de moins cher, mais tout aussi bon ?",
      "textSHA256": "a09ebafc51a0a06578848cd34c460778345e3681b6f6b6d37732e1d0cb643cde",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "l'ambiance",
      "textSHA256": "cb33a8d569fc6c6b1b114649621c19d3738e921ff04f858f4b982114780c5d14",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "l'anniversaire",
      "textSHA256": "d29a58b6e5734fa9ebbfe24ed801ce26d4df435f9c533584eeb0ec76e1c19095",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "la cuisine régionale",
      "textSHA256": "6dc4840a8757037cd720143961fe16be0b01146e6e24b1c322c0f4ae86d18c58",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "le concierge",
      "textSHA256": "075648981d7fc33c4a03561b72d9613dea834dfe2e91691905d94d7473003de0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "travel-dinner:23:fr-en",
